recommend keep-going next agent-doable crux: hue_turn joins the grammar (one u32 thirds field), then the nullary filters (blur, sharpen, stretch, edges) join together as void variants, completing the edit-list vocabulary; then a general filter round-trip witness. Hardware buys stay custody gates #2/#3.
